 y='60.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.40s'>s</text><text x='157.8' y='34.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.60s'>s</text><text x='80.3' y='60.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.79s'>s</text><text x='44.2' y='193.2' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.15s'>h</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(3)</b> P(ABCDEFGH) = 200</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 22 320 350' role='img' aria-label='Контур ABGH'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'><line x1='60.2' y1='283.8' x2='120' y2='330'/><line x1='120' y1='330' x2='195.6' y2='330'/><line x1='195.6' y1='330' x2='255.4' y2='283.8'/><line x1='255.4' y1='283.8' x2='255.4' y2='90.6'/><line x1='255.4' y1='90.6' x2='195.6' y2='44.4'/><line x1='195.6' y1='44.4' x2='120' y2='44.4'/><line x1='120' y1='44.4' x2='60.2' y2='90.6'/><line x1='60.2' y1='90.6' x2='60.2' y2='283.8'/><line x1='120' y1='330' x2='120' y2='44.4'/><line x1='195.6' y1='330' x2='195.6' y2='44.4'/><line x1='120' y1='136.8' x2='195.6' y2='136.8'/><line x1='120' y1='212.4' x2='195.6' y2='212.4'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='116' y='357'>B</text><text x='199.6' y='357'>C</text><text x='107' y='223.4'>J</text><text x='208.6' y='223.4'>K</text><text x='107' y='147.8'>I</text><text x='208.6' y='147.8'>L</text><text x='112' y='40.4'>G</text><text x='203.6' y='40.4'>F</text><text x='46.2' y='302.8'>A</text><text x='45.2' y='97.6'>H</text><text x='269.4' y='302.8'>D</text><text x='270.4' y='97.6'>E</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M60.2 283.8L120 330L120 44.4L60.2 90.6Z'/><text x='80.3' y='325.6' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.33s'>s</text><text x='136.0' y='193.2' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.96s'>c</text><text x='80.3' y='60.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.59s'>s</text><text x='44.2' y='193.2' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.06s'>h</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(4)</b> P(ABGH) = 150</p></div></div><figcaption>Четыре данных контура — четыре уравнения. Косые стороны и ширина столбика подписаны одной буквой s: по условию и рисунку они равны. Высота всего столбика c есть только в (2) и (4), вертикаль h — только в (3) и (4).</figcaption></figure>",
 "Стык CF лежит внутри и в контур не входит": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 22 320 350' role='img' aria-label='Контур FGJK'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'><line x1='60.2' y1='283.8' x2='120' y2='330'/><line x1='120' y1='330' x2='195.6' y2='330'/><line x1='195.6' y1='330' x2='255.4' y2='283.8'/><line x1='255.4' y1='283.8' x2='255.4' y2='90.6'/><line x1='255.4' y1='90.6' x2='195.6' y2='44.4'/><line x1='195.6' y1='44.4' x2='120' y2='44.4'/><line x1='120' y1='44.4' x2='60.2' y2='90.6'/><line x1='60.2' y1='90.6' x2='60.2' y2='283.8'/><line x1='120' y1='330' x2='120' y2='44.4'/><line x1='195.6' y1='330' x2='195.6' y2='44.4'/><line x1='120' y1='136.8' x2='195.6' y2='136.8'/><line x1='120' y1='212.4' x2='195.6' y2='212.4'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='116' y='357'>B</text><text x='199.6' y='357'>C</text><text x='107' y='223.4'>J</text><text x='208.6' y='223.4'>K</text><text x='107' y='147.8'>I</text><text x='208.6' y='147.8'>L</text><text x='112' y='40.4'>G</text><text x='203.6' y='40.4'>F</text><text x='46.2' y='302.8'>A</text><text x='45.2' y='97.6'>H</text><text x='269.4' y='302.8'>D</text><text x='270.4' y='97.6'>E</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M195.6 44.4L120 44.4L120 212.4L195.6 212.4Z'/><text x='157.8' y='34.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.37s'>s</text><text x='87.5' y='134.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.92s'>c − r</text><text x='157.8' y='234.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.47s'>s</text><text x='228.1' y='134.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.02s'>c − r</text></svg><p class='ccap'>P(FGJK) = 2s + 2 · (c − r)</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 22 320 350' role='img' aria-label='Контур BCDEFG'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'><line x1='60.2' y1='283.8' x2='120' y2='330'/><line x1='120' y1='330' x2='195.6' y2='330'/><line x1='195.6' y1='330' x2='255.4' y2='283.8'/><line x1='255.4' y1='283.8' x2='255.4' y2='90.6'/><line x1='255.4' y1='90.6' x2='195.6' y2='44.4'/><line x1='195.6' y1='44.4' x2='120' y2='44.4'/><line x1='120' y1='44.4' x2='60.2' y2='90.6'/><line x1='60.2' y1='90.6' x2='60.2' y2='283.8'/><line x1='120' y1='330' x2='120' y2='44.4'/><line x1='195.6' y1='330' x2='195.6' y2='44.4'/><line x1='120' y1='136.8' x2='195.6' y2='136.8'/><line x1='120' y1='212.4' x2='195.6' y2='212.4'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='116' y='357'>B</text><text x='199.6' y='357'>C</text><text x='107' y='223.4'>J</text><text x='208.6' y='223.4'>K</text><text x='107' y='147.8'>I</text><text x='208.6' y='147.8'>L</text><text x='112' y='40.4'>G</text><text x='203.6' y='40.4'>F</text><text x='46.2' y='302.8'>A</text><text x='45.2' y='97.6'>H</text><text x='269.4' y='302.8'>D</text><text x='270.4' y='97.6'>E</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M120 330L195.6 330L255.4 283.8L255.4 90.6L195.6 44.4L120 44.4Z'/><text x='157.8' y='352.0' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.31s'>s</text><text x='235.3' y='325.6' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.52s'>s</text><text x='271.4' y='193.2' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.90s'>h</text><text x='235.3' y='60.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.28s'>s</text><text x='157.8' y='34.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.49s'>s</text><text x='104.0' y='193.2' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.00s'>c</text></svg><p class='ccap'>P(BCDEFG) = 4s + h + c</p></div></div><figcaption>Два спрошенных контура. У FGJK боковая сторона — верхний этаж вместе с квадратом, то есть высота столбика без нижнего этажа: c − r. У BCDEFG стык CF ушёл внутрь, а слева осталась вся высота столбика c.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Сколькими способами он может расставить 7 фишек": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 286 58\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:320px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"48\" y=\"10\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"86\" y=\"10\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"124\" y=\"10\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"162\" y=\"10\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"10\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"238\" y=\"10\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/></svg><figcaption>Доска из условия: одна строка из 7 клеток, в каждую встанет ровно одна фишка.</figcaption></figure>",
 "островки однобуквенные, а между соседними островками стоит хотя бы одна Z": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 286 78\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:320px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"29.0\" y=\"55.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><rect x=\"48\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"67.0\" y=\"55.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><rect x=\"86\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"105.0\" y=\"55.0\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Z</text><rect x=\"124\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"143.0\" y=\"55.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B</text><rect x=\"162\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"181.0\" y=\"55.0\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Z</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"219.0\" y=\"55.0\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Z</text><rect x=\"238\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"257.0\" y=\"55.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B</text><path d=\"M13 24 V16 H83 V24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--gold)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"48.0\" y=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">островок</text><path d=\"M127 24 V16 H159 V24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--gold)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"143.0\" y=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">островок</text><path d=\"M241 24 V16 H273 V24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--gold)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"257.0\" y=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">островок</text></svg><figcaption>Расстановка AAZBZZB: три островка — AA, B, B. Каждый из одной буквы, и между любыми двумя стоит хотя бы одна Z, поэтому A и B нигде не касаются.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Кладу её туда сразу — это не выбор": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 258 110\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:300px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M13 78 Q22 66 31 78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"102\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"34\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\"/><text x=\"53.0\" y=\"54.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">□</text><rect x=\"72\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\"/><text x=\"91.0\" y=\"54.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">□</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--bg2)\" stroke=\"var(--red)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"129.0\" y=\"55.0\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Z</text><text x=\"129.0\" y=\"22\" fill=\"var(--red)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">обязательная</text><path d=\"M120.0 78 Q129.0 66 138.0 78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"129.0\" y=\"102\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"148\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\"/><text x=\"167.0\" y=\"54.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">□</text><rect x=\"186\" y=\"30\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\"/><text x=\"205.0\" y=\"54.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">□</text><path d=\"M227 78 Q236 66 245 78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"102\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text></svg><figcaption>Мир «две двойки» (m1): две двойки □□ и обязательная Z между ними. Две оставшиеся Z раскладываются по промежуткам 1, 2, 3 — в средний тоже можно, там станет две Z подряд.</figcaption></figure>",
